  "ruleText": "Rev 1101.19 \"Object code\" means a 3-digit code added to a function code which signifies a particular service or commodity obtained.\n\nSource. #8306, eff 3-22-05 (from Rev 1101.17); ss by #10304, eff 3-22-13; ss by #13503, eff 12-9-22",
